WEBVTT

00:02.576 --> 00:05.739
<i>It seems today that all you see</i>

00:05.846 --> 00:08.906
<i>Is violence in movies and sex on TV</i>

00:09.049 --> 00:12.417
<i>But where are those
good old-fashioned values</i>

00:12.854 --> 00:15.322
<i>On which we used to rely?</i>

00:15.890 --> 00:19.053
<i>Lucky there's a family guy</i>

00:19.193 --> 00:22.526
<i>Lucky there's a man who positively can do</i>

00:22.630 --> 00:23.928
<i>All the things that make us</i>

00:24.032 --> 00:25.897
<i>Laugh and cry</i>

00:26.001 --> 00:30.665
<i>He's a family guy</i>

00:37.313 --> 00:39.577
<i>Coming up, a New Orleans man says
his socks are finally dry.</i>

00:39.682 --> 00:42.014
<i>But first, the big news
in entertainment this week</i>

00:42.118 --> 00:44.348
<i>is the lovable child actress, Olivia Fuller.</i>

00:44.454 --> 00:47.719
Oh, my God, Brian, that's Olivia
from the performing arts school.

00:47.824 --> 00:51.317
What sort of overblown contract
has that dreadful bitch landed now?

00:51.428 --> 00:55.262
<i>Most of you know Olivia as the
adorable little girl in the Tasty Juice ads.</i>

00:55.366 --> 00:59.735
- Hey, Mom, can I have some soda?
- No, but you can have some Tasty Juice.

00:59.837 --> 01:04.866
- It has only one-third the sugar of soda.
- Delicious. Thanks, Mom.

01:09.815 --> 01:12.750
But little Olivia's career may be over
just as it begins

01:12.851 --> 01:15.649
with today's announcement
that Tasty Juice will be dropping her

01:15.754 --> 01:19.088
as their spokesperson
and replacing her with a new ad campaign

01:19.192 --> 01:21.217
featuring rock and roll legend Chuck Berry.

01:21.327 --> 01:23.318
Open your mouth, baby, here it comes.

01:24.630 --> 01:27.190
But there is a silver lining
for local Quahogians,

01:27.300 --> 01:30.064
as Miss Fuller will be appearing
at the Quahog Mall this weekend

01:30.169 --> 01:33.731
to mark the grand opening
of the new Brat Wraps kids clothing store.

01:33.841 --> 01:35.035
Oh, that's perfect.

01:35.142 --> 01:38.475
Brian, we have to go down there
this weekend and heckle her roundly.

01:38.579 --> 01:42.071
