03:01.501 --> 03:02.729
That's a lot of money to them.

03:02.869 --> 03:05.634
Lois, I'm just warning you,
if this movie turns me gay,

03:05.739 --> 03:07.297
I'm gonna start bringing gay guys home.

03:07.408 --> 03:08.705
