03:15.482 --> 03:16.915
Peter, it's starting.

03:20.889 --> 03:22.379
You must be Autumn Daniels.

03:22.490 --> 03:24.185
Welcome to Barncliffe school for girls.

03:24.292 --> 03:25.316
