I don't know where I get it from.

14:24.567 --> 14:27.092
What the hell is wrong with you?
You're acting like a jerk.

14:27.203 --> 14:30.639
Oh, I'm acting like a jerk?
What about Phony Curtis over there?

14:30.740 --> 14:34.039
He happens to be a very intelligent,
successful actor.

14:34.144 --> 14:36.443
And, you know, he's done
three national diaper commercials.

14:36.547 --> 14:39.380
Yeah, they should put a diaper on his face.
That's where the crap is coming out.

14:39.483 --> 14:42.077
You don't own me.
I can talk to whoever I want.

14:42.186 --> 14:43.847
I don't see a ring on my finger.

14:46.257 --> 14:49.989
I, Stewie, take you, Olivia,
to be my lawfully wedded wife.

14:50.228 --> 14:53.061
What's that, Rupert?
Oh, kiss the bride. Yes.

14:53.165 --> 14:55.099
Whoo!

15:01.606 --> 15:02.904
Hi, honey, I'm home!

15:03.009 --> 15:04.476
Hi, sweetie, how was your day?

15:04.577 --> 15:06.204
Well, I was an astronaut for a while,

15:06.312 --> 15:09.247
then I was a cowboy,
and then all afternoon I was a fireman,

15:09.348 --> 15:11.748
so it's been a long one.

15:11.851 --> 15:14.479
- What's for dinner?
- Play-Doh spaghetti.

15:15.455 --> 15:16.445
What?

15:16.557 --> 15:18.047
No. No, it's nothing.

15:18.158 --> 15:20.649
Just had Play-Doh spaghetti last night.

15:20.761 --> 15:22.752
And that's all we had last night.

15:22.863 --> 15:24.956
- What does that mean?
- Oh, I don't know, Olivia.

15:25.065 --> 15:29.126
Maybe that we are in a sexless marriage.
We have yet to have sex.

15:29.236 --> 15:31.137
Do you even know what sex is?

15:31.239 --> 15:33.639
That's not the point! Don't change the...
It's a kind of cake?

15:33.742 --> 15:36.472
Look, can we just drop this
and have a normal pretend dinner?

15:36.578 --> 15:40.446
Fine, fine! Some days I think
it was easier being Q*Bert's roommate.

15:42.283 --> 15:44.013
God, it's all night with this guy.

15:44.120 --> 15:46.020
Hey, if you're gonna leave
all those lights on,

15:46.122 --> 15:47.453
I'm not gonna split the electric bill.

15:53.729 --> 15:55.162
Sorry we're late, everyone,

15:55.264 --> 15:57.927
but JonBenet here
took forever with her makeup.

15:58.034 --> 16:01.435
Yes, and we probably would've shaved
a few minutes off our trip,

16:01.538 --> 16:04.473
but Mr. Cheapo here refused
to let the valet touch his Big Wheel,

16:04.574 --> 16:07.873
so we had to drive around the block
six times till we could find a spot.

16:07.978 --> 16:10.379
But to his credit,
it's a great spot to get mugged.

16:10.481 --> 16:14.144
Oh, wouldn't that be a shame if they took
all my money out of both our wallets?

16:14.252 --> 16:15.844
Well, it's just good to have you guys here.

16:15.953 --> 16:19.013
- Can I get you folks something to drink?
- Yes, I'll just have flat water.

16:19.123 --> 16:21.489
Do you have Hl-C Tropical Punch?

16:21.592 --> 16:23.287
And it begins!

16:23.394 --> 16:25.329
What? I can't have a drink with dinner?

16:25.430 --> 16:27.921
Oh, so dinner started
at 2:00 this afternoon, did it?

16:28.033 --> 16:30.627
Yes, about the same time
you decided to hole up in the bathroom

16:30.736 --> 16:32.328
for three hours waxing your eyebrows.

16:32.437 --> 16:33.870
You swore you would never...

16:33.972 --> 16:37.135
I have a prominent brow,
and I do what I can to get by.

16:37.242 --> 16:39.541
Well, hey,
what's important is that you're here now.

16:39.646 --> 16:42.638
- Let's just enjoy dinner.
- Yeah, can't we just have a good time?

16:42.749 --> 16:45.149
Ask Olivia. Olivia, the three of us
are having a great time.

16:45.251 --> 16:46.240
What's your problem?

16:46.352 --> 16:48.877
My problem is you.
You're acting like a baby!

16:48.988 --> 16:52.288
And we come
to the center of the shrubbery maze.

16:52.393 --> 16:54.452
That's what it all comes down to, isn't it?

16:54.562 --> 16:56.223
I'm not grown up enough for you.

16:56.330 --> 16:58.025
Well, you are a baby, aren't you?

16:58.132 --> 16:59.394
Stay out of it. Stay out of it.

16:59.500 --> 17:02.196
Well, if you think I'm a baby,
then perhaps I should act like a baby.

17:05.440 --> 17:08.807
Hey, could you keep that kid quiet?
- Oh, what's that?

17:08.910 --> 17:12.073
What's that, sir? What's that?
I'm sorry, am I being too loud for you?

17:12.180 --> 17:14.171
You wanna come over here
and quiet me down?

17:14.282 --> 17:15.840
- Let's not do this.
- Oh, God.

17:15.951 --> 17:17.282
- Stewie, come on.
- I'm scared.

17:17.385 --> 17:19.650
No, it's okay. It's okay. Sir?
You feel strong?

17:19.755 --> 17:20.881
You wanna come over here?

17:20.990 --> 17:22.548
No, I want to stay here
and have my steak.

17:22.658 --> 17:23.784
- Oh, yeah?
- Yeah.

17:23.893 --> 17:25.485
- What is that, the porterhouse?
- Yeah.

17:25.595 --> 17:27.119
- How is it?
- What do you care?

17:27.230 --> 17:28.561
If we weren't fighting,
would you recommend it?

17:28.664 --> 17:29.722
Yeah, I would.

17:29.832 --> 17:31.926
Well, I know what I'm getting.

17:36.707 --> 17:40.473
Hello, everyone.
Well, here we are, opening night.

17:40.878 --> 17:43.574
You know, somebody once told me
that making movies was easy.

17:43.680 --> 17:45.114
Yeah. Yeah, you know what else is easy?

17:45.216 --> 17:47.810
- Open heart surgery.
Yes!

17:47.919 --> 17:49.546
Yeah, thanks for coming, Fouad.

17:49.654 --> 17:52.782
Oh! Is funny because
open heart surgery not easy at all.

17:52.891 --> 17:55.689
Yeah, yeah, yeah. Calm down, Fouad.

17:55.793 --> 17:59.230
So, without further dudes,
let's watch this thing.

18:01.867 --> 18:04.859
<i>At first, I didn't believe
in women and unicorns,</i>

18:04.970 --> 18:08.462
<i>but that was before
I knew about the power of chick stuff,</i>

18:08.574 --> 18:11.805
<i>and before I knew Vageena Hertz.</i>

18:11.911 --> 18:13.106
Sorry.

18:13.213 --> 18:17.843
<i>When Vageena was first born,
I had a small heart and a lot to learn.</i>

18:17.951 --> 18:21.443
Push, honey!
Hurry up and give me my baby boy!

18:23.290 --> 18:25.485
Cleveland, more SpaghettiOs.

18:26.260 --> 18:28.091
Oh, good, a baby.

18:28.195 --> 18:30.060
Oh, no, it's a girl.

18:30.164 --> 18:31.529
And I hate girls.

18:31.666 --> 18:32.655
<i>But one day,</i>

18:32.767 --> 18:36.066
<i>Vageena went swimming
too soon after eating a sandwich,</i>

18:36.170 --> 18:37.228
<i>and this happened.</i>

18:37.338 --> 18:38.703
Help! Help!

18:38.806 --> 18:41.571
I'm drowning! Help!

18:41.944 --> 18:46.347
We gotta get this woman to surgery time.
Right stat now!

18:46.448 --> 18:48.040
<i>But it was too late,</i>

18:48.150 --> 18:50.778
<i>and she died from a rotten vagina.</i>

18:52.922 --> 18:55.390
Wow, that was the worst piece of crap
I've ever seen.

18:55.491 --> 18:57.891
Oh, my God, that was an abomination.

18:57.994 --> 18:59.518
That was awful. Awful. Awful, awful.

18:59.629 --> 19:01.221
My ass is actually sore.

19:01.331 --> 19:03.322
My ass is actually sore.

19:07.471 --> 19:10.565
- Hey, where's Olivia?
- Oh, she's probably up at the house.

19:10.674 --> 19:12.437
- Stewie?
- Yeah?

19:12.543 --> 19:13.942
It's not your fault.

19:14.044 --> 19:15.705
- What?
- It's not your fault.

19:15.813 --> 19:16.905
I know.

19:17.014 --> 19:18.413
It's not your fault.

19:18.515 --> 19:19.709
I know.

19:19.851 --> 19:21.250
No, Stewie, Stewie.

19:21.353 --> 19:22.479
It's not your fault.

19:22.587 --> 19:24.851
Don't do this to me, man. Not you, man.

19:24.956 --> 19:27.424
- It's not your fault.
- Screw you! Cut it out, man!

19:27.525 --> 19:29.254
It's not your fault.

19:29.394 --> 19:31.453
Why is it so hard?

19:31.563 --> 19:34.226
I didn't know it was gonna be so hard.

19:35.835 --> 19:38.929
Look, Stewie, you stood up before God
and all your toys

19:39.038 --> 19:41.768
and you took an oath to stick it out
when things got tough.

19:41.874 --> 19:44.809
You want her to see you as an adult?
Well, this is adulthood.

19:44.910 --> 19:47.812
You're right, Brian.
I can't hide from this relationship.

19:47.914 --> 19:50.246
It's my responsibility to deal with it.

19:50.350 --> 19:53.581
I mean, what kind of a man would I be
if I ran off now?

19:53.687 --> 19:56.747
Well, you'd be a black man.

19:56.857 --> 19:59.155
- Whoa, what was that?
- I'm sorry.

19:59.259 --> 20:01.057
I'm sorry. That was my father talking.

20:01.162 --> 20:04.097
You gotta work on that, man.

20:04.198 --> 20:05.460
Bad dog.

20:07.835 --> 20:09.268
Sweetie, listen, I'm sorry, I...

20:10.471 --> 20:11.438
Oh, Stewie!

20:11.539 --> 20:13.837
I thought you were at Chuck E. Cheese
with your mom.

20:13.942 --> 20:16.570
No. A four-year-old died in the ball pit.

20:16.678 --> 20:17.940
We had to cancel.

20:18.047 --> 20:20.447
Is that the Silly Putty
I bought you this weekend?

20:20.549 --> 20:22.141
Stewie, this isn't what it looks like.

20:22.251 --> 20:24.219
Yeah, Stewie, I just dropped by to...

20:24.319 --> 20:26.310
Ain't nobody talking to you.

20:26.655 --> 20:27.782
Is

20:27.891 --> 20:28.858
that

20:28.958 --> 20:30.425
the Silly Putty

20:30.527 --> 20:31.755
I bought you

20:31.861 --> 20:32.919
this weekend?

20:33.029 --> 20:35.998
You know, I'm really...
I'm sensing something here that...

20:36.099 --> 20:37.191
I should be going.

20:37.300 --> 20:40.360
No, how about you stay here
and I leave and never come back again?

20:40.470 --> 20:42.837
Stewie, this isn't how I wanted it to end.

20:42.940 --> 20:47.274
But you did want it to end.
You've made that perfectly clear.

20:48.312 --> 20:52.043
- Listen, are you gonna be all right?
- Yeah, I'll be fine.

20:52.149 --> 20:53.912
Is that smoke?

20:55.787 --> 20:59.518
Idea for a farce, cheating wife
and pompous ass burned alive.

21:10.736 --> 21:11.828
So, what happened?

21:11.938 --> 21:13.906
Well, you want to know
what I learned this week?

21:14.006 --> 21:15.633
Being a grown-up sucks.

21:15.741 --> 21:18.266
Women, Brian,
what a royal pain in the ass!

21:18.377 --> 21:20.937
It's like,
why can't you just hang out with guys?

21:21.047 --> 21:23.778
You know,
just live with someone of your own sex.

21:23.884 --> 21:25.374
Just do what you would do with women,

21:25.486 --> 21:28.182
but with your buddy.
You know, why don't guys just do that?

21:28.288 --> 21:30.085
They do. It's called being gay.

21:30.190 --> 21:31.555
Oh, that's what gay is?

21:31.658 --> 21:33.285
Oh, yeah, I could totally get into that.

21:33.286 --> 22:34.286
Thank you for watching «Family Guy» on
www.FOX-fan.ru